==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ru|повѣ́дать||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|ru|orv|*повѣдѣти}}; reshaped based on {{m|ru|ве́дать}}. {{surf|ru|по-|ве́дать}}.

Cognates include {{cog|pl|powiedzieć}}, {{m|pl|powiadać}}, {{cog|cs|povědět}}, {{m|cs|povídat}}, {{cog|sk|povedať}}, {{cog|sh|povijedati}}, {{cog|uk|пові́дати}}, {{cog|be|распавяда́ць}}, {{cog|sl|povedati}}, {{cog|bg|изповя́дам}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|пове́дать}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-поведать.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|пове́дать|pf|impf=пове́дывать}}

# {{lb|ru|dated|or|literary}} to [[tell]], to [[retell]], to [[recount]], to [[say]]
